        "official_en_sha256": "86c7ea080ef7ffb3bc50e1409dcba401e9291fb493d6198f884fbc7b3df4e8c5"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ここの住民はさ\r\n先祖さまが住みついてから長いからね。\r\n瘴気への耐性を獲得しとる。",
        "official_en": "Our bodies have become accustomed to the miasma, as we have lived on this land since the time of our ancestors.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
