        "official_en_sha256": "4e60fa4bfd4681f757abbeccf85b1d04d8138aff14816fd6135b1b358eb09920"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "へぇ……。\r\nあの魔法を覚えられるとは。\r\n光の導き手……ということか。",
        "official_en": "Wow... Must be one the light’s chosen, being able to learn a spell like that.",
        "real_en": "Wow... You managed to learn that spell. So you're a guide of the light..."
      },
