        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Town_08Gro_20:FEV_Town_08Gro_20_002:754d4ef4",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Town_08Gro_20:FEV_Town_08Gro_20_002:754d4ef4",
        "jp_sha256": "d75befd5c903b618fa4da5ccd16391cfa42edf374da274fd7fd5010821d67546",
        "official_en_sha256": "50f450ed2e054021f101a804139421f104732000beb56bac88059831181f301a"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "まさか……。\r\nガベラダの婆さんから\r\nホーリーを教わったのか？",
        "official_en": "Wait, did you learn Holy from the old gal there?",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
