        "official_en_sha256": "40e5523d5a539f72f5d515b55d4adae14b9f39613f24f9fad478978387aacde5"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "外には２つの神殿があるが\r\nあれはある男が、武を極めるために\r\n生み出したものらしいのじゃ。",
        "official_en": "There are two shrines nearby, and it is said one was forged by a man in pursuit of martial prowess.",
        "real_en": "There are two temples outside. They say a man created both of them in pursuit of mastery of martial arts."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
