      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "瘴気から身を守る防具ってのはないが\r\nどれも品質は保証するよ。見ていってくれ。",
        "official_en": "I’ve nothing that can protect you from the miasma, but I guarantee that my wares are of the highest quality.",
